---
import { SITIO } from '../data/libro';
---
<footer class="bg-navy border-t border-white/10 py-10">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 mb-2">
      <span class="logo-mark"></span>
      <span class="font-display text-white text-lg sm:text-xl">Razón y <span class="text-gold">Sentido</span></span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1">Luis Amin Velasco Cobos · Autor de "El tiempo como entidad ontológica"</p>

    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mt-5">
      <a href="https://razonysentido.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Sitio web de Razón y Sentido" class="social-btn">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20 15 15 0 010-20z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://facebook.com/razon.y.sentido.consultor" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Facebook de Razón y Sentido" class="social-btn">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M22 12.06C22 6.5 17.52 2 12 2S2 6.5 2 12.06c0 5 3.66 9.16 8.44 9.94v-7.03H7.9v-2.91h2.54V9.41c0-2.51 1.49-3.89 3.77-3.89 1.09 0 2.24.2 2.24.2v2.46h-1.26c-1.24 0-1.63.78-1.63 1.57v1.88h2.78l-.45 2.91h-2.33V22c4.78-.78 8.44-4.94 8.44-9.94z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Raz%C3%B3nysentido-b7s" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="YouTube de Razón y Sentido" class="social-btn">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M23.5 6.2a3 3 0 00-2.1-2.1C19.6 3.6 12 3.6 12 3.6s-7.6 0-9.4.5A3 3 0 00.5 6.2 31 31 0 000 12a31 31 0 00.5 5.8 3 3 0 002.1 2.1c1.8.5 9.4.5 9.4.5s7.6 0 9.4-.5a3 3 0 002.1-2.1A31 31 0 0024 12a31 31 0 00-.5-5.8zM9.6 15.5V8.5l6.3 3.5-6.3 3.5z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/luis-velasco-0235a9329" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn de Luis Amin Velasco" class="social-btn">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.03-1.85-3.03-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.66H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.36-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.45v6.29zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 11.02-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 01-.02 4.12zM7.11 20.45H3.56V9h3.55v11.45z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-white/35 text-xs mt-5 max-w-md mx-auto">
      El libro digital se vende en esta página con pago seguro a través de Mercado Pago y PayPal. El libro físico se compra en las librerías asociadas de cada país.
    </p>
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-5 mt-5 text-xs text-white/30">
      <button type="button" data-legal-open="terminos" class="hover:text-white/60 transition-colors">Términos</button>
      <button type="button" data-legal-open="privacidad" class="hover:text-white/60 transition-colors">Privacidad</button>
      <a href={SITIO.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-white/60 transition-colors">Contacto</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-white/15 text-xs mt-4">© <span id="footer-year"></span> Luis Amin Velasco Cobos · Todos los derechos reservados</p>
  </div>
</footer>
